//! Music's words: scales and chords (the modes, their degrees, a note's
//! pitch, the chords on a degree), an instrument's note (its sound, its
//! envelope, its vibrato) and the drums of a kit. What a program plays
//! with them, its songs and its tunes, is its own.
package music@1 { language = 1; ir = 1; }

use "kernels/";
